{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4001_001har", "source_sha256": "b11575ac117013fe291bae360bd445debf9de41d0e6aa2f90a085f575ec1c2c1", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまでした！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4002_p", "source_sha256": "9664440cd658d583d2e128ab991dc9368dfd95390ffd8eca34aed75804c60504", "ja": "春香こそ、お疲れさま。\nファンイベント、楽しかったか？", "zh": "春香你才辛苦了。\n粉丝活动开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4003_001har", "source_sha256": "b28905ac62b0d62395bf987e3a3d545f63e2301793add800fe44673b6fedaebc", "ja": "はい♪　たくさんの人に来てもらえましたし、\nいつも以上に、気合いが入っちゃいました！", "zh": "是的♪会场来了好多人，\n我也比平常还更卖力演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4004_001har", "source_sha256": "67f53264e417e36b75bbea1adf04a89bbb2fb4e4bca67f0cac33544598924f2e", "ja": "最後の曲も、すっごく盛り上がって……。\nえへへ、終わっちゃうのが、もったいなかったです♪", "zh": "唱到最后一首时，现场的气氛也变得超热烈……\n嘿嘿，都让人舍不得结束了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4005_001har", "source_sha256": "6bda2aa189a8bc0925d3300804a8074e51a2c75cb4705199ac122cd52e20f393", "ja": "あの……{$P$}さんにとっては\n今日のイベント、100点満点で何点ぐらいでした？", "zh": "那个……如果{$P$}先生\n要给今天的活动打分数的话，满分一百你会给几分？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4006_p", "source_sha256": "514c878fa2dbe48f76d618848ef5ad92be8da068e20bda7357bbfb460439931b", "ja": "今日の出来か？　うーん、そうだな……。", "zh": "你说今天的表现吗？唔～这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4007", "source_sha256": "5e2ac174dad301f2c1a8dc187a1975756bd5d3c79391b9a9c83b67a93fb0382e", "ja": "さあ？", "zh": "谁晓得？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4008", "source_sha256": "3a4f9a9af07e30990dcd77608778488b26a0897536d75d2539015e7d1c6c5ebc", "ja": "100点だ！", "zh": "100分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4009", "source_sha256": "850b89a052ee2f3c57e4e0840b08cfb77dfbc18343c2c10150a8bc2a6266f91c", "ja": "83.29点かな", "zh": "83.29分吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4100_p", "source_sha256": "2e7ea6c16d367fa86921f93f88594e0f58226babe83839a3dcc3c9805bf9e27c", "ja": "俺は点数をつけられないよ。\nファンイベントの出来は、ファンに聞いてみないと。", "zh": "我没办法打分数。\n你在粉丝活动的表现，要问粉丝才知道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4101_001har", "source_sha256": "3b9fe144770778d249f6f36c0374520130c6d8b38d0192520d9db5a249e5154a", "ja": "あ、そうですよね。ということは……。\n最後も盛り上がったし、喜んでもらえたのかも！", "zh": "啊，说得也是。这么说的话……\n最后气氛这么热烈，粉丝们应该都看得很高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4102_001har", "source_sha256": "9c8ab34ad8203669b5aafaecf6456c2cdc76316db52b09d7d7d695f8ccb1eaad", "ja": "次のステージでも、いっぱい喜んでもらわなくちゃ。\n{$P$}さん、私、頑張ります♪", "zh": "下次的表演，我也得让大家看得尽兴才行。\n{$P$}先生，我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4200_p", "source_sha256": "5df3df8d4f2abd9922cf9b90b7cd0b6438f4ed1852e6f43bf208be0284e41942", "ja": "もちろん、100点満点だ！\nよく頑張ったな、春香。", "zh": "当然是100分满分！\n你很努力了，春香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4201_001har", "source_sha256": "2791f15acf91b4053eed7b5c28c3ee1139942d02875ea85ca5999548855b01ba", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとうございます♪\nふう、よかった～。", "zh": "哇～谢谢你的肯定♪\n呼，太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4202_001har", "source_sha256": "56a550ec68626018a89e3d8f168a9ee54f6c0d0d0ac7f047bc1e76a7a3df03ee", "ja": "次も100点もらえるように、頑張らなくちゃっ。\nまた、よろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "我下一场表演也要努力拿到100分才行呢！\n下次也要再请你多多指教啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4300_p", "source_sha256": "c1fd3482f9020c59866d54b68981e788802e0e77e04b794b6e9fb614859f171f", "ja": "83.29点かな。合格点だけど、\n春香なら、もう少しできたと思うんだ。", "zh": "83.29分吧？是有到及格分数，\n但我认为春香应该还能再表现得更好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_4301_001har", "source_sha256": "1c1f3a5831f819f7827cf2e9193b9bc9e20310ff9bfc046545bc746d68520cd0", "ja": "そ、そうですか……。ありがとうございます……。\nあの、どうして小数点なのか……私考えてみます！", "zh": "是、是这样啊……谢谢你的意见……\n那个，我会思考看看……为什么分数会有小数点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
